# The chatbot was scrapped (owner decision 2026-10-01) and replaced by the
# offline ambient facts bot. There is no proxy, no key and no server-side code;
# these ignores are retained only as defence in depth in case a stray local
# secret file is ever created.
.env
*.key
secrets.json

# Local scratch
.agent_tmp/
.proof_tmp/

# The knowledge generator is a REQUIRED deliverable (not a build artefact):
# override the framework-level "build_*.py" ignore so it is committed.
!build_knowledge.py
!scripts/build_knowledge.py

# The AC-133 evidence bundle is regenerated, not hand-written: this generator
# re-runs the five delivered suites and re-derives every row, so a stale or
# internally contradictory gen11_change_report.json cannot ship again. Required
# deliverable, so the "build_*.py" ignore must not swallow it.
!scripts/build_gen11_report.py

# The personal-pages pass (2026-10-05). Same reasoning: these are deliverables,
# not one-off maintenance tooling, so the framework-level "build_*.py" and
# "verify_*.py" ignores must not swallow them.
!scripts/build_personal.py
!scripts/personal_digest.py
!scripts/send_digest_email.py
!tests/verify_personal.py
!tests/verify_gen3.py
